  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.header": "Building a stable for your drekki",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_1": "The Drekki Hatchery is where an egg hatches, and where your drekki live when they are not with you",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_2": "An egg hatches only under a roof: every block of a 3x3 over the hatchery covered, 3 to 10 blocks up",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_3": "The two blocks right above the hatchery must stay clear",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_4": "The 3x3 need not be centered: a hatchery in a corner of the roof works too",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_5": "It also needs some light around it",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_6": "Put an egg in the nest. After three days it is ready: right-click the nest to hatch it",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_7": "The pup appears right next to the hatchery",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_8": "Drekki that live here wander within 3 blocks of an anchor. The hatchery is the first anchor",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_9": "Straw Bedding is an anchor too: the area grows 3 blocks around it. Drekki like to rest on it, and sleep there at night",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_10": "So is a dirt path. Anchors chain: from the bedding a drekki may follow the path, 3 blocks either side, up to 25 blocks from the hatchery",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.stable.text_11": "Up to 20 drekki live at one hatchery. Use its screen to check one out, check one in, or release one",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_line.header": "Building a line of troughs",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_line.text_1": "The Drekki Trough holds food for drekki. Its low open side faces you when you place it; sneak to place it facing away",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_line.text_2": "Troughs side by side that face the same way join into one straight line, up to 10 long",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_line.text_3": "An 11th stays a trough of its own, and so does one placed around a corner",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_line.text_4": "A line acts as one trough: food anywhere in it feeds a drekki at any part, and every plaque shows its diet",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_line.text_5": "Right-click with food to put it in, or with an empty hand to open the trough",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_diets.header": "The four diets",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_diets.text_1": "Every trough, or line, holds one diet. The first food put in sets it, and food of another diet is refused",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_diets.text_2": "Raw: raw meat and fish",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_diets.text_3": "Cooked: cooked meat and fish",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_diets.text_4": "Seed: seeds, and crops grown from a seed",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_diets.text_5": "Root: roots, berries, and crops planted as themselves",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_diets.text_6": "A pup has no diet yet: what it eats most decides it. Fill the troughs nearest its hatchery with the diet you want",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_diets.text_7": "Once it is a fledgling its diet is set, and it eats only from troughs holding that diet",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_feeding.header": "How drekki eat from a trough",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_feeding.text_1": "Pups and fledglings eat through the low open side, standing in front of it",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_feeding.text_2": "Each trough in a line feeds one drekki at a time, so many can eat at once: a line of 10 feeds 10, as long as each has room to stand",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_feeding.text_3": "A blocked open side feeds no pup or fledgling there: keep the spot in front clear",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_feeding.text_4": "Mature drekki are tall enough to eat from the top, from any side that is not blocked",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_feeding.text_5": "A meal is one item. After it a drekki waits a moment before it eats again, so the others get a turn",
  "rancher_companion.ponder.trough_feeding.text_6": "Drekki that live at a hatchery use the troughs inside their wander area, so place troughs along your paths and bedding"
}
